WEBVTT

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:18.990
<b><i>We look the same, but men call us monsters. 

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:24.870
The last shogun has
already made his decision.

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:26.160
Takechiyo.

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:26.770
Yes, sir.

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:29.220
Kunichiyo.

00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:29.850
Yes, sir.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:32.710
No matter what judgment is given,

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:35.730
this was his decision.

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:39.010
You must not complain.

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:44.730
And both the one who was chosen 
and the one who was not,

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:47.480
are not to be jealous of one another,

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:52.220
but to work together for the glory 
of the Tokugawa family.

00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:53.240
Understood?

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:53.950
Yes, sir!

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:29.240
"The last to write on this 
was the Iga ninja Oboro."

00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:31.320
Thus, Iga is the winner.

00:01:33.950 --> 00:01:37.970
Takechiyo-sama will be the winner.

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:42.750
Get that blood-covered thing out of here.

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:29.480
<b><i>The Five Treasures Have Arrived</i></b>

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:37.520
The Five Treasures have arrived.

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:41.270
Who are these people?

00:03:41.270 --> 00:03:42.410
Iga.

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:47.130
Known as the Kurokuwa, they aren't 
even worthy of being called ninjas.

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:50.780
Laborers, essentially.

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:54.420
How powerful are you, Five Treasures of Koga?

00:03:55.190 --> 00:04:00.420
Why do you Iga wish to stop Suruga-sama?

00:04:15.670 --> 00:04:17.830
<i>Ninja Technique: Grass Fire!</i>

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:33.980
My whips slash through flesh 
like pomegranates,

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:36.650
and snap bones like icicles.

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:40.090
Let the melody of the heavens 
send you to hell!

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:46.590
Gei'in!

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:52.060
<i>Ninja Technique: Darkness Spider.</i>

00:04:56.870 --> 00:04:58.450
What is this darkness?

00:04:58.450 --> 00:05:00.550
Gei'in, I can't see a thing!

00:05:14.670 --> 00:05:18.180
So they intend to strike while 
hidden in the darkness?

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:19.400
Laughable.

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:21.420
Taste my ninja technique!

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:37.580
No matter how you try to dispel it,

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:42.270
you cannot escape my ninja 
technique, Firefly Squid.

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:46.460
It's my sweat. The sweat of Shichito Gei'in.

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:47.400
Tenshin!

00:06:08.520 --> 00:06:13.690
Gei'in-sama's Firefly Squid is a 
light that leads you to hell.

00:06:13.690 --> 00:06:16.090
My caltrops, the Thousand-Handed Kannon,

00:06:16.090 --> 00:06:18.720
are the light of virtue that leads to heaven.

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:21.440
Know this.

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:30.250
Thanks for bringing me 
these when it's so late.

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:32.050
It's fine.

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:33.940
Get home.

00:06:33.940 --> 00:06:37.030
Tengus are said to be on 
the mountains at night.

00:06:37.030 --> 00:06:37.690
Yeah.

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:40.980
My child...

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:43.840
Please find my child!

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:47.610
I lost... I lost sight of him 
on the mountain!

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:51.720
Just wait! I'll call the men!

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:05.160
Hachirou?

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:06.980
Yes, Hachirou.

00:07:09.890 --> 00:07:10.990
What's wrong?

00:07:11.940 --> 00:07:13.970
I wasn't going to say anything,

00:07:13.970 --> 00:07:17.490
but I decided I needed to 
talk to you, at least.

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:26.570
Don't try to be loyal now!

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:28.510
I'm in a hurry.

00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:31.500
Of course, sir.

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:34.900
We will prepare a boat immediately.

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:36.580
Tenshin. Kazuma.

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:41.020
We will go with you,

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:43.900
and you will reach your 
destination by morning.

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:47.150
You're telling the truth, 
right? You had best be!

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:52.710
Eye magic, was it?

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:57.160
The power possessed by your leader, Hachirou.

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.760
During that battle,

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:04.450
wasn't the Kouga leader said to 
have used the same technique?

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:09.950
Kouga Gennosuke... That was his name, right?

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:23.940
Those who tried to kill Gennosuke,

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:26.690
or to hurt him,

00:08:27.090 --> 00:08:29.190
or to use magic on him...

00:08:30.260 --> 00:08:32.110
Those opponents, alone,

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:36.790
were affected by his illusion skill that 
caused them to destroy themselves.

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:49.050
That was Gennosuke's eye magic.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:50.810
Right?

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:56.090
I've only ever heard of it.

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:58.850
Then, you don't know the details?

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:01.720
<b>Nineteenth Year of the Keichou Era 

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:07.600
Both sides, put ten names
on these two scrolls.

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:14.490
This will entrust the third shogun's 
fate to the Iga and Kouga.

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:15.740
<b><i>Kouga Leader 
Kouga Danjou</i></b>

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:15.740
<b><i>Iga Leader 
Iga-no-Ogen</i></b>

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:18.740
<b><i>Kunichiyo</i></b>

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:18.740
The second son, Kunichiyo, 
will be entrusted to the Kouga,

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:21.870
and the first son, Takechiyo, to the Iga.

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:21.870
<b><i>Takechiyo</i></b>

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:26.520
Both sides, fight with all your lives.

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:27.620
<b><i>Swordsmanship Instructor 
Yagyuu Munenori</i></b>

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:32.250
The one to survive with their 
scroll will be the victor.

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:32.250
<b><i>Tokugawa Chief of Espionage 
Hattori Hanzou</i></b>

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:36.510
And their clan will be promised 
a millennium of prosperity.

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:41.510
<b><i>Tokugawa Shogunate First Shogun 
Tokugawa Ieyasu</i></b>

00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:45.430
Chou! Chou!

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:48.770
Chou! Chou!

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:54.300
Over here!

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:56.220
I heard a voice!

00:09:56.830 --> 00:09:58.780
Hey, over here!

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:07.200
There he is!

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:08.790
We found him!

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:10.290
Chou!

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:13.430
Are you hurt?

00:10:13.430 --> 00:10:15.550
Are you in pain, Chou?!

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:17.510
Chou!

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:32.410
Did Gorone agree to fix the pistol?

00:10:32.410 --> 00:10:34.840
Show him more respect.

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:39.320
He said he'd do it, but next
time, go ask him yourself.

00:10:39.620 --> 00:10:41.260
You don't get it...

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:43.080
This is me being nice to him.

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.210
Don't be stupid!

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:50.830
If you're willing to leave your 
tools to other people,

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:53.860
you'll never fulfill your duty!

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:56.200
I know that.

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:57.620
Again?

00:10:58.450 --> 00:11:01.320
You got more of this stuff?

00:11:03.340 --> 00:11:05.470
Utsutsu, those are to be sold.

00:11:05.810 --> 00:11:09.600
If only you guys could survive 
on morning dew...

00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:18.490
Hachirou!

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:23.920
Why?

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:35.380
Hibiki?

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:37.280
It's strange that she's so late.

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:39.340
She wasn't here, was she?

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:41.140
She's just a little late.

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:43.050
You needn't worry so much.

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:44.680
Sure, but...

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:46.810
What?

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:50.450
Maybe she met Hachirou.

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:52.220
Why?

00:11:52.220 --> 00:11:53.820
What's happening with Hachirou?

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:56.780
He said he's leaving the village.

00:11:57.180 --> 00:11:58.690
No way.

00:11:58.690 --> 00:12:00.440
You didn't stop him, Gorone?

00:12:01.810 --> 00:12:02.450
No.

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:05.070
Wait, Namenba!

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:08.830
Why?

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:11.630
If he's met up with Hibiki,

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:14.830
it may be better to leave this to them.

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:17.710
You think Hibiki will stop him?

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:19.080
I don't know.

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:23.240
But maybe it's fated that they 
will never be together.

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:29.780
Why are you trying to leave the 
village without telling me?

00:12:36.510 --> 00:12:41.860
Are you scared of my... of our powers?

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:50.070
I'm not scared of your power.

00:12:51.140 --> 00:12:58.640
Because unless I hate you 
or want to hurt you,

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:01.380
you can't use it on me, can you?

00:13:02.220 --> 00:13:04.230
I'd never think of you like that.

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:08.230
I know that, but...

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:14.450
And my power can do even less.

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:16.920
It can only disable an opponent's power.

00:13:17.990 --> 00:13:20.410
So why are you scared?

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:25.160
Twelve years ago,

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:29.380
in their youth, Ogen-sama and Danjou-sama,

00:13:29.380 --> 00:13:32.410
the first pair to fight, were in love.

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:36.420
And so were Gennosuke-sama and Oboro-sama.

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:40.670
But the Kouga and Iga will never fight again.

00:13:40.990 --> 00:13:43.050
Even if that's so,

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:45.880
their destiny to always be separated

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:48.930
has been inherited in another way, perhaps.

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:50.900
Another way?

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:55.180
As long as they bear Gennosuke-sama's 
and Oboro-sama's blood...

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:57.940
How much do you know, Gorone?

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:02.890
Do you know why it's said 
that they carry the blood

00:14:02.890 --> 00:14:05.820
of the two who died in that battle?

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:09.810
No one will tell me when I ask.

00:14:14.010 --> 00:14:17.960
Ninjas are beyond human 
understanding, aren't they?

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:21.490
Strange powers, like turning 
sweat into light,

00:14:21.490 --> 00:14:23.910
that change what we know 
about the world itself.

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:26.750
I am embarrassed.

00:14:26.750 --> 00:14:28.790
I'm told there was a ninja who wouldn't die.

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:30.050
Wouldn't die?

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:32.600
Yakushiji Tenzen, most likely.

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:37.030
A powerful foe, who was an 
integral part of that war.

00:14:37.030 --> 00:14:40.490
Do you think it's true that he didn't die?

00:14:40.490 --> 00:14:44.610
I'm sorry, but Tenzen was of the Iga.

00:14:44.930 --> 00:14:47.740
I don't know the details.

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:50.780
Well, I'm sure it's nonsense...

00:14:52.340 --> 00:14:56.120
But Gennosuke defeated even 
a creature such as that.

00:14:57.490 --> 00:15:02.200
So how did he lose to this Iga Oboro woman?!

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:05.130
You've noticed, right?

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:08.780
Of course you have.

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:12.330
When the last cherry blossoms bloomed...

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:29.530
It's the first time... 
It's the first time I won!

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:34.530
That was deliberate, wasn't it?

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:39.280
Hachirou, are you being kind to me,

00:15:39.850 --> 00:15:42.170
your little sister?

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:48.520
You aren't being kind at all.

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:03.640
Hachirou?

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:05.440
I...

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:36.630
That was a whirlwind...

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:38.700
It had to be.

00:16:45.660 --> 00:16:46.870
Hey, Gei'in...

00:16:48.050 --> 00:16:52.240
Naturally, you know the man 
named Hattori Kyouhachirou?

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:54.790
Of course.

00:16:54.790 --> 00:16:58.630
The son of the second Hattori Hanzou-sama.

00:16:58.630 --> 00:16:59.490
Indeed.

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:05.730
And in the last battle between 
Oboro and Gennosuke,

00:17:05.730 --> 00:17:09.040
he and the second Hanzou were there, as well.

00:17:19.710 --> 00:17:24.450
They both overextended their powers and died.

00:17:24.450 --> 00:17:27.430
Oboro-sama lived slightly longer,

00:17:27.430 --> 00:17:30.070
long enough to write the Iga 
victory into the scroll.

00:17:30.930 --> 00:17:35.360
That is how it was relayed 
to some of the Shogunate.

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:39.800
But the story told in this 
village differs slightly.

00:17:42.300 --> 00:17:45.210
Before the last battle began,

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:48.070
Gennosuke-sama was already hurt.

00:17:48.070 --> 00:17:51.880
He couldn't open his eyes to use his power.

00:17:57.550 --> 00:18:01.560
I love you, Gennosuke-sama.

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:17.750
Gennosuke-sama embraced 
Oboro-sama, who had killed herself,

00:18:17.750 --> 00:18:21.880
and wrote the Iga victory into 
the scroll with his own hands.

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:22.900
And then...

00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:47.770
But...

00:18:48.380 --> 00:18:53.440
Yes, it isn't even known 
how much of this is true.

00:18:54.890 --> 00:18:57.730
There's a story that the man 
called Hattori Kyouhachirou,

00:18:57.730 --> 00:19:01.030
on the morning when Gennosuke 
and Oboro were to end their war,

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:03.750
met with Oboro in secret.

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:05.620
Have you heard that?

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:08.210
No, I have not.

00:19:08.450 --> 00:19:11.570
Was there some secret agreement between them?

00:19:11.970 --> 00:19:14.750
Originally, the Hattori clan 
was part of the Iga.

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:19.870
Perhaps he gave Oboro some plan, 
so that the Iga would win.

00:19:20.560 --> 00:19:22.580
Isn't that possible?

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:27.550
When I was still eight or nine,

00:19:27.550 --> 00:19:31.130
someone came to the Kouga 
village to visit Gei'in-sama.

00:19:39.960 --> 00:19:41.800
Then, that was...

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:42.810
Yes.

00:19:42.810 --> 00:19:44.490
Kyouhachirou-sama.

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:06.560
If... If Kyouhachirou-sama actually 
saved those two,

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:07.510
then why?

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:09.450
I don't know.

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:12.550
As head of espionage for the Tokugawas,

00:20:12.550 --> 00:20:16.540
he tried to ensure the bloodline of 
such powerful ninjas continued.

00:20:16.540 --> 00:20:19.140
That's the most obvious explanation.

00:20:19.140 --> 00:20:23.900
But I'd like to think that 
he was moved by how,

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:28.420
despite their being destined 
to be torn apart,

00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:30.840
they sacrificed themselves, 
for love of one another.

00:20:32.070 --> 00:20:36.520
Otherwise, it would be far too 
sad for Hachirou and Hibiki.

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:40.240
I don't care what happens, if I'm with you!

00:20:48.370 --> 00:20:49.680
I should give it up.

00:20:51.840 --> 00:20:55.060
Yes, laugh and tell me that I should.

00:20:55.770 --> 00:21:03.560
But I still can't believe that that 
decision was the right one!

00:21:17.910 --> 00:21:18.730
Tenshin!

00:21:19.350 --> 00:21:21.770
Close the door.

00:21:21.770 --> 00:21:23.430
The cold wind is hitting my lord!

00:21:23.430 --> 00:21:24.590
The rain is hitting him!

00:21:25.870 --> 00:21:28.790
I'm afraid I cannot.

00:21:29.700 --> 00:21:30.340
What?

00:21:30.340 --> 00:21:34.850
Why? Why can you not shut the door?

00:21:35.720 --> 00:21:36.880
It's because...

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:38.610
Because...

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:41.730
Your... neck.

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:44.240
Because I'm already...

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:54.410
dead...

00:23:25.050 --> 00:23:27.050
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:26.120 --> 00:23:31.190
A ninja spends his life to 
refine his technique.

00:23:31.190 --> 00:23:36.980
To fulfill his duty to his lord.

00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:38.560
<b><i>The Kouga Must Die</i></b>

00:23:36.980 --> 00:23:39.620
Oh, poor Gei'in...
